<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 810)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Every manual figure reshot</b> against current work (Help &#9656; Asobi Manual) &#8212; the cheat sheet, the transport bar, the palette, the panels, the reports and the rest.</li>
<li>Small fixes found while doing it: the colour helper can be dismissed from a script, and the notes panel can be asked for a state rather than toggled blind.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
